  "thig13.5:23.1": "Reading <i>hitvā</i> with the Thai edition. The other editions have <i>katvā,</i> “done.”",
  "thig13.5:23.2": "",
  "thig13.5:23.3": "",
  "thig13.5:23.4": "",
  "thig13.5:24.1": "",
  "thig13.5:24.2": "",
  "thig13.5:24.3": "Reading <i>ratā,</i> delighting, with the Thai edition. The Sinhalese and PTS read <i>tesaṁ,</i> so that the line means “in the ending of their fetters”; the Burmese edition reads <i>sabba-,</i> so that the line means, “in the ending of all fetters.”",
  "thig13.5:24.4": "",
  "thig13.5:25.1": "",
  "thig13.5:25.2": "",
